Source: secubox-config-advisor
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Gerald KERMA <devel@cybermind.fr>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: secubox-config-advisor
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, secubox-core (>= 1.0.0)
Description: SecuBox Config Advisor — security configuration audit + recommendations
 Scans installed SecuBox config (nftables rules, nginx vhosts,
 systemd unit hardening, AppArmor profiles, file permissions) and
 surfaces deviations from the CSPN-aligned baseline. Read-only;
 produces an actionable recommendations report rather than auto-
 applying fixes.
